OL,3,GNEWSAMan in his 60s dies after being
OL,4,Ahit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 60s has died after he was
OL,7,Fhit by a car.
OL,9,FHertfordshire Police said the
OL,10,Fpedestrian was in a collision with a
OL,11,Fblue Vauxhall Astra on the High Street,
OL,12,Fnear Cowper Road, in Berkhamsted,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, at 22:10 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FA 26-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,16,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,17,Fdriving and remained in custody, the
OL,18,Fforce added.
OL,20,FOfficers have appealed for witnesses,
OL,21,For those with dashcam footage, to
OL,22,Fcontact them.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
